<title>USA: New York physical copper market - July 8.</title>
<headline>New York physical copper market - July 8.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-07-08</dateline>
<text>
<p>Based on COMEX settlement prices, merchant copper cathodes for July shipment were quoted at a nominal 110.15 to 110.40 cents a lb.</p>
<p>Dealers quoted No.2 scrap copper at a nominal 86.00 cents, down 4.00 cents from July 7.</p>
<p>-- New York Commodity Desk, 212-859-1640</p>
</text>
